classes\ should\ not\ call\ a\ @Transactional\ method\ of\ the\ same\ class,\ because\ an\ intra-class\ call\ to\ a\ @Transactional\ method\ bypasses\ the\ Spring\ proxy\:\ no\ transaction,\ no\ tenant\ scope,\ silently=5fd7a288-80de-453b-8772-d59e5277fa43
